FoamFile{version 2.0;format ascii;class dictionary;location "constant";object fvOptions;}
// A SAFETY NET, NOT THE MECHANISM. On M6I the equivalent limiter reported zero limited cells
// on 5,968 of 5,997 iterations and did no work at all: THE RAMP IS THE MECHANISM. This exists
// so that a transient excursion bounds rather than faults the thermo in libm, and the number
// of cells it limits is REPORTED so its contribution can never be silently assumed.
limitT
{
    type            limitTemperature;
    active          yes;
    selectionMode   all;
    min             100;
    max             1000;
}
